        "* **What is STABLEPAY?**\n",
        "  STABLEPAY is a decentralized cross-border payment platform that enables fast, secure, and low-cost international settlements using a demo USD stablecoin (sUSD).\n",
        "* **How are on-chain transaction verifications managed in the backend?**\n",
        "  On-chain verifications are executed using the Ethers library connected via a JSON-RPC provider (such as Sepolia). The backend retrieves transaction receipts, decodes events using a minimal ERC-20 Transfer ABI, and confirms that the token receiver and payment amount match the database record before updating the status to `COMPLETED`.\n",
        "* **What currencies and exchange rates are supported, and how are transaction fees structured?**\n",
        "  The platform supports USD, EUR, GBP, INR, SGD, AED, and JPY. Exchange rates are pegged to sUSD as the base currency ($1.00$). There is a flat platform service fee of $0.5\\%$ calculated on the USD-equivalent value of the transfer.\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "### Data Analysis Key Findings\n",
        "\n",
        "* **Five Seeded Settlement Scenarios**: The database contains five realistic simulation paths, demonstrating diverse currencies and payment outcomes:\n",
        "  1. **USD to INR**: Alice Vance (US) transfers $\\$1,000$ to Devish Sharma (India) yielding $83,250$ INR with a $416.25$ INR fee (Status: `COMPLETED`).\n",
