        "  5. **USD to EUR**: Jane Smith (US) attempts a $\\$250$ transfer which resolves to `FAILED` due to an invalid destination address check.\n",
        "* **On-Chain Event Verification Rules**: The verification engine rules demand that a transaction has a status of $1$ (successful block confirmation) and matches the target transfer amount within a floating threshold margin of $< 0.001$ units.\n",
        "* **Dynamic Sidebar Architecture**: The frontend application contains an integrated navigation pane showcasing 12 responsive dashboards, with interactive tabs for initiating transactions and stepping through simulation timelines.\n",
